  lineId: guide_5_steps
  speakerOverride: 
  text: 'Station 5 Steps: 1) Plug Red (+) to P-Terminal & Black (-) to N-Terminal and raise V above 0.7V to light the LED (Forward Bias), 2) Swap Red->N & Black->P to watch W widen (Reverse Bias), 3) Sweep past -50V for Breakdown, then press RESET STATION!'
